#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:803
#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:849
msgid "Send parcels from"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:673
msgid ""
"The Speedy office you hand parcels in at. Speedy then prices and books every "
"shipment as handed in there and sends no courier for it; whether that is "
"cheaper depends on your contract. Leave empty when a courier collects from "
"your address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:678
msgid "Declared value"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:679
msgid ""
"Speedy charges a premium for it, and pays a claim only against documents "
"most shops cannot produce. Leave off unless you have agreed the claims "
"process with them. Declaring a value is supported for Speedy and Sameday; "
"the other couriers ignore it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-bgcouriers-wc-settings.php:681
